        "x1": 0.4915652709150521,
        "y1": 0.698013033616142
      },
      "text": "tal-missjoni li ntbagħat fiha  u reġa intbagħat l-Awstralja",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
